WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.130
Android can't do AirPlay. Now it can.

00:03.130 --> 00:07.500
ScreenDock turns any Android into an AirPlay receiver.

00:07.500 --> 00:11.250
Open Control Center, tap Screen Mirroring, pick ScreenDock.

00:11.250 --> 00:15.000
Phones. Tablets. Android TV. 4K, 60 fps, H.265, ALAC.

00:15.000 --> 00:17.500
No ads. One-time Pro. Open source.

00:17.500 --> 00:21.250
ScreenDock: AirPlay Receiver. Free on Google Play.
